        {
          "id": 1063018437,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Yes, I guess I'm wondering if both 40 and 41 are OOO. \n\nBecause if 41 came before 40, the whole trace would be good/correct - 40 is an `ack` using the new sequence number from 41.",
          "author": {
            "id": 2616346,
            "username": "jonluca",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "JonLuca De Caro",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/2616346/avatar.png?v=1789018034",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/jonluca"
          },
          "created_at": "2022-08-14T17:20:43.225Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-10-11T07:59:43.108Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 171150726,
